# prompt: airy UI transition swipe
# tags: whoosh, transition, swipe, ui
# The one whoosh here that only rises: a transition is going somewhere, and a
# filter that comes back down would read as something passing by instead of a
# screen arriving.
sound "ui swipe" 420ms
  swipe: noise white >> bp ~2200Hz[900..5000] -> ~6000Hz[2500..12000] in 160ms Q1.4 | gain 0.46 attack 60ms decay 240ms
  tail: noise pink >> hp ~4000Hz[1800..9000] | gain 0.22 attack 80ms decay 260ms delay 40ms
